{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VZ5eusu7KMDDcAAvGzLa5w","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"ACL Rolling Review review form 2025 2026 overall assessment score scale 1-5\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/\"},{\"title\":\"Review Form – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform\"},{\"title\":\"Incentives 2026 – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2026\"},{\"title\":\"CALL FOR PAPERS – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/cfp\"},{\"title\":\"ACL ARR 2025 May | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=aclweb.org%2FACL%2FARR%2F2025%2FMay\"},{\"title\":\"How ARR works – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewing\"},{\"title\":\"aclrollingreview/cfp.md at main · acl-org/aclrollingreview\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/acl-org/aclrollingreview/blob/main/cfp.md\"},{\"title\":\"Dates and Venues – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/dates\"},{\"title\":\"Main Conference - ACL 2026\",\"url\":\"https://2026.aclweb.org/calls/main_conference_papers/\"},{\"title\":\"ARR Changelog – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/changelog\"}]\n\nI found information about ACL Rolling Review, but the search results don't contain specific details about the overall assessment score scale (1-5) in the review form. Let me search more specifically for the review form scoring scale.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Review Form – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform\"},{\"title\":\"How ARR works – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewing\"},{\"title\":\"ARR Reviewer Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewerguidelines\"},{\"title\":\"ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/\"},{\"title\":\"🎪 ACL 2025 Reviews Are Out: To Rebut or Flee? The Harsh Reality of NLP’s \\\"Publish or Perish\\\" Circus | CSPaper Forum\",\"url\":\"https://forum.cspaper.org/topic/27/acl-2025-reviews-are-out-to-rebut-or-flee-the-harsh-reality-of-nlp-s-publish-or-perish-circus\"},{\"title\":\"aclrollingreview/reviewertutorial.md at master · acl-org/aclrollingreview\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/acl-org/aclrollingreview/blob/master/reviewertutorial.md\"},{\"title\":\"ARR Area Chair Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/acguidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Action Editor Form – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/actioneditorform\"},{\"title\":\"aclrollingreview/reviewform.md at main · acl-org/aclrollingreview\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/acl-org/aclrollingreview/blob/main/reviewform.md\"},{\"title\":\"Intructions for Reviewers - EACL 2021\",\"url\":\"https://2021.eacl.org//reviewers/\"}]\n\nBased on my web search, I found information about the ACL Rolling Review (ARR) review form and its overall assessment score scale. Here's what I found:\n\n## Overall Assessment Score Scale (1-5)\n\nThe ACL Rolling Review form uses a 1-5 scale for overall assessment, with the following definitions:\n\n- 5 = Excellent: This study is one of the most thorough I have seen, given its type.\n- 4 = Strong: This study provides sufficient support for all of its claims. Some extra experiments could be nice, but not essential.\n- 3 = Acceptable: This study provides sufficient support for its main claims. Some minor points may need extra support or details.\n- 2 = Poor: Some of the main claims are not sufficiently supported. There are major technical/methodological problems.\n- 1 = Major Issues: This study is not yet sufficiently thorough to warrant publication or is not relevant to ACL.\n\nAdditionally, the scale includes 1.5 = Resubmit after next cycle: I think this paper needs substantial revisions that cannot be completed by the next ARR cycle.\n\n## Three Scoring Components\n\nStarting with February 2025, ARR reviewers are asked to provide three scores: soundness, excitement, and overall recommendation. The Overall assessment score is an explicit recommendation for the outcome of this paper, if it were committed to an *ACL venue. This is a composite score reflecting your assessment of soundness, excitement, and also other factors like novelty and impact.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93355213-87f8-4b5a-b04b-1b0ebb649ece","uuid":"4d76f55d-0171-4735-bb39-c6552b48377b","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:32:56.246Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"ACL Rolling Review review form 2025 2026 overall assessment score scale 1-5","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01EkAcvgq1XG4i6RyVrctaai","content":[{"title":"ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/"},{"title":"Review Form – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform"},{"title":"Incentives 2026 – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2026"},{"title":"CALL FOR PAPERS – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/cfp"},{"title":"ACL ARR 2025 May | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=aclweb.org%2FACL%2FARR%2F2025%2FMay"},{"title":"How ARR works – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewing"},{"title":"aclrollingreview/cfp.md at main · acl-org/aclrollingreview","url":"https://github.com/acl-org/aclrollingreview/blob/main/cfp.md"},{"title":"Dates and Venues – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/dates"},{"title":"Main Conference - ACL 2026","url":"https://2026.aclweb.org/calls/main_conference_papers/"},{"title":"ARR Changelog – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/changelog"}]},"I found information about ACL Rolling Review, but the search results don't contain specific details about the overall assessment score scale (1-5) in the review form. Let me search more specifically for the review form scoring scale.",{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_016Ck1z8VXqsgkeDq85467Xi","content":[{"title":"Review Form – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform"},{"title":"How ARR works – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewing"},{"title":"ARR Reviewer Guidelines – ACL R